From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 18:54:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 186/191] [ae-patch] Make the model change band's actions look
 clickable

Undo and Open helper become filled chips (Undo in the accent), and Dismiss becomes a close box at the row's right edge, so the row grows by 2 px at most. Each chip has an invisible 28 px tap area.
---
 web/src/components/AeModelChangeBand.test.tsx | 41 ++++++++++++++-
 web/src/components/AeModelChangeBand.tsx      | 50 +++++++++++++------
 2 files changed, 74 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

diff --git a/web/src/components/AeModelChangeBand.test.tsx b/web/src/components/AeModelChangeBand.test.tsx
